{"title": "River Chionthar", "pageid": 13151, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/River_Chionthar", "categories": ["Locations", "Lore"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Loading_Screen_Area_Overview.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Loading_Screen_Area_Overview.png/300px-Loading_Screen_Area_Overview.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Loading_Screen_Area_Overview.png/450px-Loading_Screen_Area_Overview.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Loading_Screen_Area_Overview.png/600px-Loading_Screen_Area_Overview.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Loading_Screen_Area_Overview.png/300px-Loading_Screen_Area_Overview.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Loading_Screen_Area_Overview.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>The River Chionthar seen from the southern bank.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <b>River Chionthar</b> is a wide river that runs from Iriaebor to the Sword Coast. <a href=\"/wiki/The_Risen_Road\" title=\"The Risen Road\">The Risen Road</a> runs parallel to the river.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\">Overview</span></h2>\n<p>In <i><a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a></i>, the story winds west through the valleys of the river, culminating in the eponymous city of <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"Baldur's Gate\">Baldur's Gate</a>.\n</p><p>Many cities and settlements are on or near the banks of the river. The citystate of <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"Baldur's Gate\">Baldur's Gate</a> has its harbour in the river's estuary. <a href=\"/wiki/Rivington\" title=\"Rivington\">Rivington</a> is a small settlement on the eastern outskirts of Baldur's Gate. <a href=\"/wiki/Wyrm%27s_Crossing\" title=\"Wyrm's Crossing\">Wyrm's Crossing</a>, a double bridged fortress, allows the Coast Way to cross the Chionthar into Baldur's Gate. Continuing eastward and upriver one can find <a href=\"/wiki/Blighted_Village\" title=\"Blighted Village\">Moonhaven</a> and the city of <a href=\"/wiki/Elturel\" title=\"Elturel\">Elturel</a>, among others.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_items\">Related items</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fish\" title=\"Fish\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/FOOD_Fish_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-FOOD_Fish_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/FOOD_Fish_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-FOOD_Fish_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/FOOD_Fish_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-FOOD_Fish_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/FOOD_Fish_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-FOOD_Fish_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/FOOD_Fish_A_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Fish\" title=\"Fish\">Fish</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sunmelon_Piece\" title=\"Sunmelon Piece\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bb/FOOD_Sunmelon_Piece_Unfaded_icon.png/30px-FOOD_Sunmelon_Piece_Unfaded_icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bb/FOOD_Sunmelon_Piece_Unfaded_icon.png/45px-FOOD_Sunmelon_Piece_Unfaded_icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bb/FOOD_Sunmelon_Piece_Unfaded_icon.png/60px-FOOD_Sunmelon_Piece_Unfaded_icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bb/FOOD_Sunmelon_Piece_Unfaded_icon.png/30px-FOOD_Sunmelon_Piece_Unfaded_icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bb/FOOD_Sunmelon_Piece_Unfaded_icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Sunmelon_Piece\" title=\"Sunmelon Piece\">Sunmelon Piece</a></span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_literature\">Related literature</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flow_of_the_Chionthar\" title=\"Flow of the Chionthar\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Book_Generic_K_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_K_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Book_Generic_K_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Generic_K_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Book_Generic_K_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Generic_K_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Book_Generic_K_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_K_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Book_Generic_K_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Flow_of_the_Chionthar\" title=\"Flow of the Chionthar\">Flow of the Chionthar</a></span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/River_Chionthar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer no